From e9b1f96030cf5eac8874eb4994a599c1be2e4a2f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 30 Jul 2026 15:59:31 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: add "Translate now" button to the admin experience
 editor

Lets you sync an experience's translations (content, sections, facts,
hero titles) with one click right after creating or editing it,
instead of waiting for it to appear in a real proposal or having to
run the backfill script from a terminal. Reuses the same idempotent,
hash-based sync already used by the on-demand pipeline and the
backfill script, so re-clicking it (or running the backfill
afterwards) never re-translates unchanged rows.

